视觉中心。\n\n周围拼贴小图\n\n围绕中心主体排布 4~6 张照片切片。\n\n内容包括：\n\nwink脸部特写\n单眼近景特写\n嘴唇特写\n半身自拍视角\n手部动作特写\n腿部穿搭局部\n鞋子局部\n\n要求：\n\n大小不同\n微微倾斜\n错位摆放\n有重叠压层\n像剪贴杂志照片\n边框\n\n所有拼贴照片统一：\n\n细白色描边边框（1px）\n\n像拍立得照片边缘。\n\n装饰元素\n\n自然加入：\n\nHello Kitty 卡通贴纸\n粉色爱心 doodle\n泡泡\n粉色蝴蝶结\nsparkles\nsticker elements\n手帐贴纸装饰\n\n分布在照片之间与留白区域。\n\n文字排版\n\n加入粉色装饰英文字：\n\nPink\nHello Kitty ~\nSweet\nLove\nBaby Girl\n\n字体：\n\n手写粉色字体\n花体英文\n\n作为点缀。\n\n光影质感\nsoft studio lighting\nbeauty editorial photography\nglowing skin\nsoft highlight\nsmooth skin texture\nclean white light\ndreamy soft light\n色彩风格\n\n整体：\n\n粉黑撞色 + 白底 + 奶油粉点缀\n\n风格：\n\nsweet but cool\nkawaii\ny2k girl\neditorial collage poster\nscrapbook magazine layout\n\nremove original photo background completely, cut out the character cleanly, replace with pure white studio background, seamless white backdrop, no room background, no furniture, no environment visible"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [582.4562377929688, 415.63006591796875], "pos": [5923.17431640625, 272.7415466308594], "id": 52, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [155], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [6316.451171875, -1440.8221435546875], "widgets_values": ["基于输入的单张人物照片，保留原图人物 100% 面部特征、五官比例、发型、身材比例、服装穿搭与整体气质，人物本人作为唯一主体。\n\n生成一张 甜酷 Y2K × Hello Kitty 风格少女拼贴写真海报。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 95, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"nam